{"id":"5d75e4fc6653b234","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-uniformization.md","title":"c.e. 关系的选择函数","display":"thm-uniformization — c.e. 关系的选择函数","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-uniformization","aliases":["20-thm-uniformization"],"display":"thm-uniformization — c.e. 关系的选择函数","chapter":"2","section":"2.1.2","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 2.1.8，包括统一指标条款","source_pdf_pages":[61],"source_printed_pages":[25],"depends_on":["[[20-df-re]]","[[20-df-partial-function]]","[[20-df-pairing]]","[[20-df-stages]]","[[20-thm-smn]]","[[20-df-computable]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-uniformization"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-uniformization</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-uniformization — c.e. 关系的选择函数"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.1.2"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 2.1.8，包括统一指标条款"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>61</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>25</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3f7915f8f8ad037c\" href=\"?note=3f7915f8f8ad037c\" title=\"20-df-partial-function\">20-df-partial-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq\\omega^2\">\\(R\\subseteq\\omega^2\\)</span> 的配对编码属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal E\\)</span>；对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e\">\\(e\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_e:=\\{(x,y):\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in W_e\\}\">\\(R_e:=\\{(x,y):\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in W_e\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C_1\">\\(\\mathcal C_1\\)</span> 为部分可计算函数族。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"3f7915f8f8ad037c\" href=\"?note=3f7915f8f8ad037c\" title=\"20-df-partial-function\">20-df-partial-function</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"e343870c773cb68e\" href=\"?note=e343870c773cb68e\" title=\"20-df-computable\">20-df-computable</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}uniformization}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1\\ [\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\{x:\\exists y\\ R(x,y)\\}\\land\n\\forall x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\ R(x,f(x))],\\\\\n\\exists u:\\omega\\to\\omega\\ [u\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\land\\forall e\\\n(\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_{u(e)})=\\{x:\\exists y\\ R_e(x,y)\\}\\land\n\\forall x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_{u(e)})\\ R_e(x,\\varphi_{u(e)}(x)))].\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}uniformization}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\exists f\\in\\mathcal C_1\\ [\\operatorname{dom}(f)=\\{x:\\exists y\\ R(x,y)\\}\\land\n\\forall x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(f)\\ R(x,f(x))],\\\\\n\\exists u:\\omega\\to\\omega\\ [u\\in\\mathcal C_1^{\\mathrm{tot}}\\land\\forall e\\\n(\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_{u(e)})=\\{x:\\exists y\\ R_e(x,y)\\}\\land\n\\forall x\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\varphi_{u(e)})\\ R_e(x,\\varphi_{u(e)}(x)))].\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,x\">\\(e,x\\)</span>，阶段 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\">\\(s\\)</span> 检查有限 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_{e,s}\">\\(W_{e,s}\\)</span> 是否有第一坐标为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 的配对码；首次发现时返回其中最小的第二坐标。这个算法统一于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e,x\">\\(e,x\\)</span>；s-m-n 给全可计算编译器 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u(e)\">\\(u(e)\\)</span>。若存在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R_e(x,y)\">\\(R_e(x,y)\\)</span>，相应码在某个有限阶段出现，算法必停；若不存在，则所有阶段搜索失败，算法不停。返回的值总是关系中的真实见证。</p>\n<p>不必输出数值最小的见证：一个较小见证可能晚于较大见证出现，或永不出现。统一的是返回此选择程序的索引，输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 是否停止仍由关系是否有该截面决定。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 25 / PDF 61。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"3f7915f8f8ad037c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-partial-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable","status":"resolved","id":"e343870c773cb68e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-partial-function]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-partial-function","status":"resolved","id":"3f7915f8f8ad037c","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-partial-function]]；see [[20-df-pairing]]；see [[20-df-stages]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-9","targ